      "source": [
        "# Dynamic Reflections: video-text alignment on free Colab (T4)\n",
        "Runs the authors' feature extraction with **Gemma-2-2B-it** (the 9B model does not fit a T4), then uses our own\n",
        "tested code in `refactored_modules/` for the alignment score, the frames x captions sweeps, the Eq. 2 scaling-law fit\n",
        "and a video-to-text retrieval demo. Every score is printed with N, k and the chance level; expect lower absolute values\n",
        "than the paper (2B text model), so compare trends.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Runtime > Change runtime type > T4 GPU.** Needs a Hugging Face token with the Gemma license accepted."
      ],
      "id": "KDJtCUi-8SH4"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "nUnBFs_i8SH6"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 1. Setup"
      ],
      "id": "nUnBFs_i8SH6"
    },
